cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use imprint, please cite it using these metadata.
title: >-
  imprint: somatic variant calling in paired, FACS-sorted immune-cell
  populations
abstract: >-
  imprint is a Nextflow DSL2 pipeline that calls somatic variants in paired,
  FACS-sorted immune-cell populations from bulk WES, WGS or xGen UDSeq data.
  Each donor provides one reference population and one or more populations to
  compare against it. Bulk calling combines Mutect2, Strelka2 and DeepSomatic
  with Vafator read evidence, VEP annotation and VarLociraptor probabilities.
  Duplex libraries are called with DupCaller on raw read families.
type: software
